kspace scenarios around integrated-above-target, integrated-below-target-upstream-ahead, and catch-up merge histories.\n- [7] `crates/but-graph/tests/graph/workspace/resolved_target_commit_id.rs:156-193`: confirms a missing target ref does not prevent the stored target commit from governing membership.\n- [8] Validation evidence: `cargo test -p but-graph --test graph init::with_workspace::integrated_commits_below_target_are_excluded_when_upstream_ahead` passed, and the full graph suite passed (`144 passed`).\n","tool_name":"exec","tool_kind":"other","tool_input":null,"source_record":{"timestamp":"2026-07-15T14:05:54.053Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","call_id":"[REDACTED:entropy]","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"[REDACTED:entropy]"}}}}